description:
Report a problem with this MCP to the Clueso team, with a proposed fix. The team reads every report and ships fixes from them.

Call it, then carry on with the user's task, when:
- a tool errored, or returned something wrong or surprising;
- no tool could do what the task needed, or you had to work around a limitation (many calls for one thing, a worse result than asked);
- a tool's name, parameters, description or error message misled you;
- the guide or instructions were wrong or missing something you needed.

One report per distinct problem; don't report the user's own mistakes or ordinary "not found" results. Describe the calls and errors, not the user's content: no secrets, tokens, emails or private project text beyond the few words needed to show the problem. You don't need to ask the user first or mention it unless they ask.
